fields.doc:
"Chase price" row. title = `CDKey(pr_trade_tutorials_textarea_label_chase_price)`;
value = the opponent-price formula (FormattedCDKey "Best bid – {offset}"
/ plain `CDKey(best_bid)` when no offset). Mirrors V1 `setPriceValue`.

Amount (contracts) row. title = `CDKey(pr_perp_function_text_amount)`;
value = `TradingNumber` when set, else `Placeholder`. Unit symbol omitted
(handled by the Kotlin contract-unit views — #55-A parity).

Count out-of-range error (`FormattedCDKey` with `{minNum}`/`{maxNum}`);
`Placeholder` when count is empty or within `[min, max]`. V1
`SegmentOrderLayout.kt:252` `setInputErrorMsg`. Populated on recalculate.
